# kjobs: Jobs and CronJobs, failed first, with logs and recent runs
Output docs/kjobs.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kjobs"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down
Down
Down
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 2500ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
